  "id": "corp_06_breaker",
  "side": "Corp",
  "title": "Defending against a breaker",
  "intro": "Ice only stops a Runner who cannot break it. Cleaver is a barrier breaker: for credits it raises its strength and breaks Palisade's subroutine. A Runner with the right breaker and enough credits gets through — ice taxes them, it does not wall them out.\n\nYou have Palisade in front of a remote holding Offworld Office with 2 tokens; the Runner installed Cleaver last turn. This lesson: rez when they run, and see what a breaker does.",
  "outro": "The Runner paid 3 credits and a click to steal 2 points. Ice bought you time, not safety: score faster, stack a second piece of ice, or keep the agenda in HQ until you can. The game is to 6, so this is a setback, not the end. Next: a trap.",
